# Testing Patterns

SoT: [`.specs/codebase/TESTING.md`](../../.specs/codebase/TESTING.md). Required gate: [quality-gates.mdc](quality-gates.mdc).

## Coverage

Per-file thresholds enforced on every included `src/**` and `bin/**` file. See [`.specs/codebase/TESTING.md`](../../.specs/codebase/TESTING.md) § Coverage (90% lines/functions, 80% branches/statements).

## Mock boundaries

- Mock **git** only in `GitMiner` — not in scorers, reporter, or `scan.ts`
- Mock **ts-morph** only in `ComplexityAnalyzer` — not in scoring
- Parse tests use fixtures under `tests/fixtures/git-log/` and `tests/fixtures/complexity/`

## CLI tests (`bin/*.test.ts`)

- `vi.resetModules()` before dynamic `import()` of the CLI
- Mock `process.stdout.write` and `process.exit`
- Short `setTimeout` for async CLI init when needed

## Integrity

- Prefer co-located `*.test.ts` next to the module under test
- Do not weaken coverage thresholds to greenwash a change
- Contract tests must stay green after schema edits
